        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lord William Bentinck\n- Events: Treaty of Bastia, Napoleonic Wars\n- Organizations: British forces in Italy\n- Groups: Corsican nationalists\n\nFacts:\n- Lord William Henry Cavendish-Bentinck was born on 14 September 1774 and later became known as Lord William Bentinck.\n- Lord William Bentinck was a British soldier and statesman.\n- Near the end of the Napoleonic Wars in 1814, the Treaty of Bastia was signed.\n- The Treaty of Bastia was an agreement between Corsican nationalists and Lord William Bentinck.\n- At the time of the Treaty of Bastia, Lord William Bentinck was the commander of British forces in Italy.\n- Lord William Bentinck died on 17 June 1839.",
